WEBVTT

00:11.730 --> 00:17.430
<b>Karte 6 - Night Time Tale in the Snow</b>

00:37.030 --> 00:41.160
<b>Doctor, look!
Ozozo San! Ozozo San!</b>

00:41.160 --> 00:42.270
<b>That's Ojizosan.</b>

00:42.270 --> 00:43.660
<b>Ojozo San!</b>

00:46.070 --> 00:49.600
<b>I've encountered life and death,
and once in a while,</b>

00:50.240 --> 00:52.210
<b>I've encountered things
that I cannot explain...</b>

00:52.210 --> 00:54.300
<b>things that go against reason.</b>

00:58.510 --> 01:03.080
<b>As a man of science,
I place my faith in knowledge.</b>

01:03.220 --> 01:08.490
<b>When I'm faced with things science
cannot explain, I'm full of amazement.</b>

01:09.290 --> 01:13.320
<b>I am reminded that
science is still not perfect.</b>

01:13.660 --> 01:16.630
<b>I think that it's important
to be reminded of such things.</b>

01:26.010 --> 01:28.940
<b>The mystery began
with a large package.</b>

01:30.480 --> 01:33.940
<b>Doctor, look at
what just arrived.</b>

01:39.520 --> 01:46.550
<b>Hmm... No problem,
no sign of explosives.</b>

02:01.140 --> 02:04.740
<b>This money is really old.</b>

02:04.850 --> 02:08.280
<b>There's a letter and map
together in this small package.</b>

02:08.720 --> 02:10.550
<b>To Black Jack:
Have you been well?</b>

02:10.550 --> 02:15.790
<b>I've sent you 3,747,000 yen to serve
as payment for your medical treatment.</b>

02:16.030 --> 02:22.520
<b>If it isn't enough,
I will gladly pay the rest later.</b>

02:23.230 --> 02:26.790
<b>My wife's life is at stake.</b>

02:27.340 --> 02:30.740
<b>We're not sure if she
will last until tomorrow.</b>

02:36.250 --> 02:38.300
<b>I've mailed a map along.</b>

02:38.780 --> 02:43.380
<b>We're deep in the mountains.
Please hurry over.</b>

02:44.050 --> 02:48.790
<b>I beg you. It's an emergency.
Signed, Saburo Taneda.</b>

02:49.460 --> 02:52.390
<b>Please help. Please help.</b>

02:59.270 --> 03:04.730
<b>I will rush to the village on the map,
for I have a reason to.</b>

03:06.210 --> 03:08.940
<b>Doctor, look at this.</b>

03:09.250 --> 03:14.380
<b>The date this little package was sent...
it was two years ago from today.</b>

03:14.380 --> 03:16.350
<b>Two years ago?</b>

03:16.790 --> 03:21.690
<b>I thought it was strange that
the wrapping was so worn out.</b>

03:21.920 --> 03:22.980
<b>Two years ago.</b>

03:23.530 --> 03:28.400
<b>Surely the post office must
have lost it along the way.</b>

03:28.400 --> 03:31.030
<b>Pinoko, hurry.
Prepare to leave.</b>

03:31.330 --> 03:31.960
<b>Huh?</b>

03:33.670 --> 03:35.170
<b>That letter said that she
might not survive tomorrow...</b>

03:35.170 --> 03:37.370
<b>and the letter is
from two years ago.</b>

03:54.860 --> 03:57.020
<b>I hope this trip
isn't for nothing.</b>

04:49.950 --> 04:51.970
<b>Middle town slips out</b>

04:52.050 --> 04:55.710
<b>Match my rhythm, follow me?</b>

04:55.790 --> 05:01.190
<b>Outta step
You'll be sucked in 'fore ya even know</b>

05:04.430 --> 05:07.830
<b>If you had dreams, just let go</b>

05:07.900 --> 05:10.300
<b>Must let them out</b>

05:10.370 --> 05:11.830
<b>Let go</b>

05:11.900 --> 05:16.130
<b>'Cuz you're gonna lose out on more
than anything, you're gonna...</b>

05:16.210 --> 05:17.800
<b>Miss out on...</b>

05:18.940 --> 05:22.540
<b>Oooh...
Don't play hide and seek...</b>

05:22.610 --> 05:24.670
<b>In the crowd</b>

05:26.220 --> 05:31.620
<b>Suck it in, go ahead,
and yell it out!</b>

05:33.260 --> 05:35.690
<b>Count each tear like city lights</b>

05:35.760 --> 05:40.160
<b>So you think I'm lying?
What the hell you want from me?</b>

05:40.230 --> 05:42.930
<b>Tears counted like city lights</b>

05:43.000 --> 05:47.100
<b>I can't stand to see 'em cryin'
Makes me hate more...</b>

05:47.170 --> 05:50.870
<b>And my anger just grows!</b>

06:09.960 --> 06:11.260
<b>Excuse me...</b>

06:13.160 --> 06:15.860
<b>Which way to Yashaga
Mountain's Nakazato village?</b>

06:16.130 --> 06:18.570
<b>Will we come across Himezuka?</b>

06:19.870 --> 06:25.540
<b>I know Nakazato, but
I've never heard of Himezuka.</b>

06:26.180 --> 06:28.640
<b>Nakazato is beyond
that mountain.</b>

06:29.380 --> 06:30.570
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

06:31.410 --> 06:36.580
<b>You should be careful.
Yashaga Mountain has been getting snow.</b>

06:37.920 --> 06:38.910
<b>Snow...</b>

06:39.120 --> 06:41.560
<b>They got it early this year.</b>

06:48.460 --> 06:49.870
<b>Let's go, Pinoko.</b>

06:49.870 --> 06:51.130
<b>Coming!!</b>

07:15.660 --> 07:19.820
<b>We should have reached
Nakazato by now,</b>

07:20.900 --> 07:23.870
<b>but I see no houses,
nor any markings or signs.</b>

07:24.230 --> 07:26.860
<b>We've been looking for
Himezuka for a while.</b>

07:31.570 --> 07:34.240
<b>A temple...
There's a temple nearby.</b>

07:34.940 --> 07:38.780
<b>Huh? A temple.</b>

07:38.880 --> 07:39.910
<b>We're saved.</b>

07:40.080 --> 07:42.410
<b>If there is a temple...</b>

07:43.190 --> 07:45.380
<b>then someone should be
able to show the way.</b>

07:48.820 --> 07:52.120
<b>I'm hungry.</b>

07:52.190 --> 07:54.960
<b>Well, we'll get dinner
at that temple.</b>

07:55.530 --> 07:57.760
<b>I hope we can get some.</b>

08:21.820 --> 08:23.520
<b>It's 8:35 PM.</b>

08:25.160 --> 08:30.260
<b>Stuck on a snowy road.
Probably close to Himezuka.</b>

08:36.270 --> 08:39.240
<b>I guess we have no choice
but to wait for someone.</b>

09:09.870 --> 09:13.640
<b>Pinoko, wake up.
Pinoko! Pinoko!</b>

09:35.500 --> 09:36.560
<b>Excuse me...</b>

09:38.270 --> 09:39.390
<b>Is there anyone home?</b>

09:41.070 --> 09:42.130
<b>Excuse me?!</b>

10:01.690 --> 10:03.720
<b>Who art thou?</b>

10:04.160 --> 10:09.430
<b>Hast thou cometh hither to this
mountain temple to soothe thy soul?</b>

10:13.370 --> 10:17.070
<b>Thou art weak
in spirit and lost.</b>

10:17.870 --> 10:22.170
<b>Is this the house of a man named
Saburo Taneda from Himezuka?</b>

10:22.450 --> 10:24.710
<b>I know him very well.</b>

10:25.610 --> 10:30.520
<b>Oh, she has the sleepy face
of the Goddess of Mercy.</b>

10:31.250 --> 10:35.120
<b>Do not worry.
I will taketh good care of her.</b>

10:39.060 --> 10:41.290
<b>Go for about a mile
down the road.</b>

10:41.630 --> 10:44.100
<b>Before long, thou shalt
come to see a sacred tree.</b>

11:01.280 --> 11:02.510
<b>Abumaru?</b>

11:02.890 --> 11:03.440
<b>Yes.</b>

11:04.090 --> 11:08.460
<b>If it doesn't go well, will thou
be able to act with haste?</b>

11:08.920 --> 11:09.720
<b>Of course.</b>

11:10.330 --> 11:12.760
<b>He is the doctor
called on by Taneda.</b>

11:13.130 --> 11:14.560
<b>What do you think?</b>

11:15.000 --> 11:17.560
<b>All shalt be as thou
wisheth, Lady Kaoru.</b>

11:24.740 --> 11:28.230
<b>Before long, thou shalt
come to see a sacred tree.</b>

11:35.580 --> 11:36.480
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

11:38.950 --> 11:42.860
<b>I am Saburo Taneda.
I've been awaiting you.</b>

12:28.140 --> 12:31.600
<b>Those who live by the sword,
die by the sword.</b>

12:31.940 --> 12:35.470
<b>Let their souls be
redeemed in heaven.</b>

12:53.430 --> 12:54.660
<b>Recite the password.</b>

12:55.200 --> 12:58.560
<b>Over, over the seven
bridges of Koigase.</b>

12:58.770 --> 13:01.170
<b>Taneda, please cross over.</b>

13:28.500 --> 13:29.930
<b>This way.</b>

13:43.510 --> 13:46.610
<b>Who is it? Saburo?</b>

13:48.180 --> 13:51.680
<b>Sorry I'm late.
It's me, Saburo.</b>

13:52.920 --> 13:55.450
<b>Do you have the Yura Leaves?</b>

13:55.860 --> 13:59.860
<b>Princess, today I have brought you
something better than Yura leaves.</b>

13:59.860 --> 14:01.730
<b>A great doctor has
come to cure you.</b>

14:03.570 --> 14:06.470
<b>I asked thee a question.
Didst thou bring the Yura leaves?</b>

14:07.070 --> 14:12.200
<b>They are out of season, because of
the heavy snowfall, but I have found...</b>

14:12.540 --> 14:15.380
<b>I want the Yura leaves.
Hurry and fetch them.</b>

14:15.380 --> 14:19.340
<b>There are only a few left in the supply.
If you can please be patient...</b>

14:23.420 --> 14:25.410
<b>It hurts, it hurts.</b>

14:25.590 --> 14:26.950
<b>Princess!</b>

14:32.860 --> 14:34.350
<b>Stand back, good doctor.</b>

14:55.480 --> 14:56.350
<b>Stop it!</b>

14:57.090 --> 14:59.180
<b>The blade has been dulled
as a precaution.</b>

14:59.350 --> 15:00.820
<b>It cannot cut.</b>

15:00.820 --> 15:03.120
<b>Her fits are intense but
do not last very long.</b>

15:28.050 --> 15:28.950
<b>That's right...</b>

15:29.590 --> 15:34.080
<b>Four years ago, when the princess
was 16, she became ill.</b>

15:34.790 --> 15:40.100
<b>Mr. Rokujoji, a powerful official from Kyoto,
had become smitten with her.</b>

15:40.100 --> 15:43.620
<b>But our princess would not
return Mr. Rokujoji's love.</b>

15:46.340 --> 15:49.400
<b>Our family, while very noble,
were only mere owners of a small fiefdom.</b>

15:49.400 --> 15:52.670
<b>However, compared to Rokujyoji,
an administrator of the emperor,</b>

15:52.670 --> 15:55.280
<b>he was the one with the true power.</b>

15:55.280 --> 15:58.770
<b>He was 62 years old when he
decreed that she should be his wife.</b>

16:02.050 --> 16:06.650
<b>She was so beautiful, such a
wonderful lady faced with such a tragedy.</b>

16:07.190 --> 16:09.590
<b>She could not refuse
such a decree.</b>

16:10.260 --> 16:13.200
<b>Seeing no other way out,
on the next night,</b>

16:13.200 --> 16:17.690
<b>she ate the fruit of the Gamakazura,
which contains a deadly poison.</b>

16:21.570 --> 16:25.060
<b>We were able to save her...</b>

16:25.240 --> 16:28.210
<b>but ever since then, she
has been sick with fever.</b>

16:28.540 --> 16:30.480
<b>She has seizures
and violent fits,</b>

16:30.480 --> 16:33.880
<b>like the one you just
witnessed yourself.</b>

16:39.520 --> 16:44.980
<b>With each day, each month that has
passed, her condition has worsened.</b>

16:46.230 --> 16:49.060
<b>Her pulse is very
weak and chaotic.</b>

16:53.640 --> 16:55.070
<b>Yura leaves?</b>

16:59.780 --> 17:01.040
<b>This is it.</b>

17:05.010 --> 17:06.780
<b>It's a very strong medicine, huh?</b>

17:06.850 --> 17:09.990
<b>If she chews these leaves,
her condition improves.</b>

17:09.990 --> 17:13.440
<b>For a while, she can be at peace...</b>

17:13.890 --> 17:17.590
<b>but now only 2 leaves
remain in the supply.</b>

17:19.830 --> 17:22.590
<b>What kind of plant
is this Gamakazura?</b>

17:23.230 --> 17:27.770
<b>In the hometown of the princess,
where the Koigase begins, it grows there.</b>

17:27.770 --> 17:30.700
<b>It bears fruit once
every thirty years.</b>

17:31.110 --> 17:34.510
<b>But not many
have ever seen it.</b>

17:38.510 --> 17:44.980
<b>Saburo, the fireflies at Koigase
are so pretty, aren't they?</b>

17:46.560 --> 17:50.490
<b>The summer when I was twelve...</b>

17:57.770 --> 17:59.960
<b>Saburo, are you startled
by the fireflies?</b>

18:10.950 --> 18:12.040
<b>What's this?</b>

18:12.150 --> 18:15.810
<b>Remnants of the poison
of the Gamakazura.</b>

18:20.760 --> 18:26.130
<b>It looks like a serpent
wrapped around her body.</b>

18:46.180 --> 18:48.010
<b>I'll need to test her blood.</b>

18:51.550 --> 18:54.920
<b>My instruments... they're gone.</b>

19:08.140 --> 19:09.600
<b>It can't be helped.</b>

19:10.670 --> 19:14.110
<b>I'll have to go on my ears
and sense of touch.</b>

19:24.820 --> 19:25.790
<b>Some light.</b>

19:27.390 --> 19:29.190
<b>How's this?</b>

19:29.320 --> 19:30.690
<b>A bit lower.</b>

19:46.010 --> 19:48.100
<b>I have only come here
as a messenger.</b>

20:08.230 --> 20:10.220
<b>Did you find out what's wrong?</b>

20:10.800 --> 20:13.670
<b>The problem is her heart.</b>

20:14.870 --> 20:16.910
<b>She has a heart murmur
and her heartbeat is off.</b>

20:16.910 --> 20:18.910
<b>There must be a problem
with her heart valve.</b>

20:18.910 --> 20:21.340
<b>It's not working properly.</b>

20:22.180 --> 20:24.740
<b>And that caused the mark
of the serpent to appear?</b>

20:25.180 --> 20:26.580
<b>I can't say that for sure,</b>

20:26.950 --> 20:32.410
<b>but it might be a tumor
developing along her skin.</b>

20:33.890 --> 20:36.410
<b>She needs open heart surgery,</b>

20:36.830 --> 20:39.520
<b>but I can't perform it
without my instruments.</b>

20:41.700 --> 20:44.600
<b>What will become of her?</b>

20:45.400 --> 20:46.890
<b>I'm afraid that
without the treatment,</b>

20:47.270 --> 20:49.900
<b>it could lead to heart failure.</b>

20:51.970 --> 20:55.000
<b>If left untreated,
she could die anytime.</b>

20:55.910 --> 20:58.780
<b>That guy, he's Abumaru...</b>

20:59.410 --> 21:04.110
<b>a mere plaything of Kaoru,
Rokujyoji's wife.</b>

21:09.060 --> 21:13.390
<b>Come down, Abumaru!
Or shall I swat you down like an insect?</b>

21:14.800 --> 21:18.290
<b>A common field boy goes against
a messenger. Have you no manners?</b>

21:20.640 --> 21:27.400
<b>I bear a message from the wife of Rokujyoji,
from the revered priestess Kaoru.</b>

21:29.540 --> 21:32.610
<b>Listen carefully, for this
is her last gesture of mercy.</b>

21:32.610 --> 21:33.620
<b>Don't make me laugh.</b>

21:33.620 --> 21:36.410
<b>If it is her gesture,
then my ears will grow mold.</b>

21:36.790 --> 21:40.590
<b>Tomorrow morning, the soldiers
of Rokujyoji shall arrive.</b>

21:40.660 --> 21:42.890
<b>If you surrender the princess,
then you'll be spared.</b>

21:43.130 --> 21:49.220
<b>If you do not, then we will attack your family
and see to it that you're all hanged.</b>

21:49.760 --> 21:53.200
<b>If she is alive, you are to bring
her wearing her wedding dress.</b>

21:53.970 --> 21:58.030
<b>If she's dead, then you shall bring
her wearing her death make-up.</b>

21:59.980 --> 22:03.240
<b>The words of a jealous wench who has
lost her husband's heart to the princess.</b>

22:05.110 --> 22:07.140
<b>I heard that Rokujyoji
acknowledges your fighting skill.</b>

22:07.250 --> 22:11.020
<b>He is convinced that, for the right price,
your sword would serve him instead.</b>

22:11.220 --> 22:13.280
<b>Do not underestimate me!!</b>

22:25.370 --> 22:29.170
<b>Tell him that
the princess is my life!</b>

22:38.450 --> 22:40.350
<b>Doctor, where are you going?</b>

22:41.680 --> 22:44.480
<b>I'm going to tend to the patient.
I'll return soon.</b>

22:51.060 --> 22:55.260
<b>I had to return to our car that
was stuck on the snowy road.</b>

22:56.000 --> 22:58.970
<b>I had another set of instruments
and medicines in the car.</b>

22:59.130 --> 23:01.600
<b>I remembered that I prepared it.</b>

23:23.890 --> 23:27.090
<b>Lady Kaoru would like
to have a word with you.</b>

23:56.360 --> 23:56.980
<b>Pinoko!!</b>

24:01.160 --> 24:02.690
<b>Doctor!!</b>

24:19.050 --> 24:21.410
<b>From today forward
this child shall be mine...</b>

24:21.880 --> 24:22.650
<b>What!?</b>

24:25.220 --> 24:28.710
<b>If I can have this cute girl,
my worries are over.</b>

24:28.790 --> 24:31.690
<b>Rokujyoji will lose sight
of this other woman...</b>

24:32.460 --> 24:36.990
<b>and take me back
as his true wife.</b>

24:37.600 --> 24:42.000
<b>He will forget the Princess, and
our family will be whole once again.</b>

24:46.140 --> 24:47.440
<b>Pinoko!!</b>

24:51.180 --> 24:52.650
<b>Give Pinoko back!!</b>

24:53.580 --> 24:55.910
<b>No one can deny
Lady Kaoru's wisdom...</b>

25:25.950 --> 25:29.010
<b>Lord Rokujyoji!! We have been
awaiting your arrival.</b>

25:29.220 --> 25:34.090
<b>Abumaru... How's the Royal minx?
Does she still resist?</b>

25:35.860 --> 25:36.350
<b>Yes.</b>

25:37.430 --> 25:40.160
<b>She still has not
proclaimed her love?</b>

25:41.160 --> 25:41.650
<b>Yes.</b>

25:42.060 --> 25:46.590
<b>My hate is almost equal with
the level of love I have for her.</b>

26:11.960 --> 26:13.120
<b>Saburo.</b>

26:14.130 --> 26:15.500
<b>I'm in pain!! I'm in pain!!</b>

26:15.500 --> 26:17.260
<b>Princess, hold on!!</b>

26:17.870 --> 26:20.270
<b>Give me Yura!!
Get me some Yura leaves.</b>

26:20.270 --> 26:21.240
<b>No!!</b>

26:28.580 --> 26:30.940
<b>Princess, hold on!!</b>

26:41.590 --> 26:45.550
<b>Saburo! It's all your fault!</b>

26:47.460 --> 26:50.630
<b>Why didn't you marry me?</b>

26:52.330 --> 26:57.200
<b>I told you that I loved you
at the Koigase River.</b>

26:59.670 --> 27:00.660
<b>Princess!</b>

27:01.910 --> 27:04.710
<b>If you had married
me soon after,</b>

27:05.410 --> 27:08.440
<b>then Rokujyoji would probably
not have had a chance.</b>

27:08.780 --> 27:15.660
<b>Princess, that was impossible.
I was a mere subject. I was so afraid.</b>

27:16.060 --> 27:19.390
<b>Do you dislike me, Saburo?!!</b>

27:20.860 --> 27:22.830
<b>No, it's just...</b>

27:22.830 --> 27:28.790
<b>If that was the case, we could have
left the country and been together.</b>

27:30.710 --> 27:34.440
<b>Forgive me, beautiful one.
My respect for thee was too great!</b>

27:34.980 --> 27:38.970
<b>To consider thee in such terms
was unthinkable! Forgive me.</b>

27:40.750 --> 27:45.780
<b>When I took the poison,
I wanted to go to heaven.</b>

27:47.260 --> 27:52.420
<b>I thought we could be
together there forever.</b>

27:54.100 --> 27:55.760
<b>Forgive me!!</b>

28:08.840 --> 28:11.900
<b>Furthermore, Rokujyoji's
contempt for my actions...</b>

28:13.150 --> 28:15.880
<b>has led to the attack
on my village...</b>

28:16.120 --> 28:20.880
<b>and the murder of my parents
and their most loyal subjects.</b>

28:21.990 --> 28:27.330
<b>Above all else, as long as I live,
he will chase me to the ends of the world.</b>

28:29.300 --> 28:35.730
<b>Also, I will go to hell for
the suffering I caused you all.</b>

28:38.270 --> 28:41.830
<b>I know you will not be
reunited with me in hell.</b>

28:43.440 --> 28:44.410
<b>Princess...</b>

28:45.280 --> 28:46.080
<b>Saburo!!</b>

28:46.450 --> 28:50.950
<b>My final wish is for you to take my
head and send it to Lord Rokujyoji.</b>

28:50.950 --> 28:52.610
<b>Princess!!</b>

28:53.720 --> 28:55.690
<b>Do not forget to apply
my death make-up.</b>

28:55.820 --> 28:57.480
<b>Princess!!</b>

28:59.290 --> 29:01.130
<b>Release me, Saburo!! Do it!</b>

29:01.260 --> 29:05.290
<b>We will not lose, Princess.
No matter what, we will not lose.</b>

29:18.410 --> 29:19.850
<b>Prepare some hot water.</b>

29:21.680 --> 29:26.620
<b>And some clean towels...
we'll start the operation.</b>

29:38.470 --> 29:43.840
<b>Lord Rokujyoji has arrived.
He has set up camp here in Yashaga.</b>

29:48.710 --> 29:51.580
<b>He requests
an audience with you.</b>

30:06.030 --> 30:11.190
<b>Well done. You have chased down
the Princess' people and decimated them.</b>

30:11.700 --> 30:13.830
<b>I'm truly indebted to you.</b>

30:14.070 --> 30:18.700
<b>Leave the rest to me.
You can return to your path as a priestess.</b>

30:19.210 --> 30:25.270
<b>No... I'll stay here until
I see her head brought here.</b>

30:25.750 --> 30:27.380
<b>Don't say that, Kaoru.</b>

30:27.380 --> 30:30.840
<b>That beautiful princess...
Why do you want her head?</b>

30:31.320 --> 30:34.720
<b>It has come this far.
Still that girl has denied you.</b>

30:36.860 --> 30:39.330
<b>That denial has driven me.</b>

30:48.800 --> 30:50.600
<b>Abumaru, we're going back.</b>

30:50.770 --> 30:51.430
<b>Yes.</b>

30:54.180 --> 30:58.340
<b>No, I will heed the wishes
of the one who was my love.</b>

31:12.090 --> 31:17.050
<b>Good, now I will put you into
a deep sleep with anesthesia.</b>

31:17.900 --> 31:20.960
<b>That way, I can examine
the inside of your body.</b>

31:21.300 --> 31:24.140
<b>I will focus on your heart since
that is the cause of the problem.</b>

31:25.210 --> 31:28.770
<b>I will do all I can
to remove this sickness.</b>

31:29.180 --> 31:32.240
<b>When you wake from this sleep,
you will be cured.</b>

31:34.720 --> 31:39.150
<b>Okay, you just sleep.
Leave everything else to me.</b>

31:39.350 --> 31:39.910
<b>Yes.</b>

31:40.660 --> 31:42.490
<b>Then close your eyes.</b>

31:53.200 --> 31:54.400
<b>Aren't you feeling sleepy?</b>

31:56.240 --> 31:57.000
<b>No.</b>

31:57.670 --> 31:58.830
<b>It's not strong enough.</b>

31:59.010 --> 32:01.630
<b>Without anesthesia,
this operation is impossible.</b>

32:03.180 --> 32:04.440
<b>Get me a Yura leaf...</b>

32:06.050 --> 32:07.910
<b>Saburo, get me a Yura leaf!</b>

32:08.920 --> 32:10.380
<b>Saburo!! My final wish is for you
to take my head and send it to...</b>

32:11.090 --> 32:12.380
<b>Princess...</b>

32:35.040 --> 32:40.840
<b>The Yura leaf had an interaction with
the Ketamin I injected her with...</b>

32:41.420 --> 32:45.150
<b>and the result was
a perfect anesthetic effect.</b>

32:53.860 --> 32:55.920
<b>I will begin with
the chest incision.</b>

33:00.900 --> 33:02.460
<b>Lady Kaoru!! What is it?</b>

33:03.400 --> 33:05.110
<b>Her face is a pale blue!!</b>

33:05.110 --> 33:08.380
<b>Don't worry...
Let's hurry to the temple.</b>

33:08.380 --> 33:08.970
<b>Yes.</b>

33:23.420 --> 33:24.620
<b>Lady Kaoru!! What is it?</b>

33:26.590 --> 33:29.190
<b>Close the door. Leave me alone!</b>

33:29.830 --> 33:30.590
<b>Yes.</b>

33:38.710 --> 33:42.780
<b><i>Koku shu zyuh gyaku daku</i>
<i>datsu la ku yaku bin ju...</i></b>

33:42.780 --> 33:46.550
<b><i>shitsu enn kyuh kyoh</i>
<i>betsu gyaku enn.</i></b>

33:46.550 --> 33:50.720
<b><i>Sou shi tou mitsu jya shin</i>
<i>han ki fu on metsu...</i></b>

33:50.720 --> 33:55.260
<b><i>mu ju koku shi kai nen</i>
<i>ki fun kai shuu betsu...</i></b>

33:55.260 --> 33:59.790
<b><i>gu bou batsu me shitsu</i>
<i>ken chou kon setsu...</i></b>

33:59.790 --> 34:04.100
<b><i>ta ju letsu koku dou</i>
<i>katsu mou kon dai an ju...</i></b>

34:04.100 --> 34:06.070
<b><i>yuu ge goku gen jo.</i></b>

34:06.370 --> 34:07.600
<b>What is this?</b>

34:51.950 --> 34:54.180
<b>Lady Kaoru!!
My liege, Lady Kaoru!!</b>

35:17.940 --> 35:21.570
<b>Once her incisions heal,
she shouldn't experience any more pain.</b>

35:22.740 --> 35:25.080
<b>Thank you!! Thank you!!</b>

35:25.680 --> 35:29.910
<b>No, the one who defeated
the mysterious affliction was you.</b>

35:30.250 --> 35:34.150
<b>You truly saved this patient.
It was you.</b>

35:46.870 --> 35:48.960
<b>We're under attack!!</b>

36:11.260 --> 36:13.850
<b>If those incisions open up,
it'll be the end of her life.</b>

36:14.000 --> 36:16.730
<b>I want to thank you
for all your efforts.</b>

36:17.100 --> 36:18.400
<b>Taneda!!</b>

36:22.000 --> 36:24.940
<b>Whether it be hell or heaven,</b>

36:24.940 --> 36:30.340
<b>I shall go together
with my princess.</b>

36:30.340 --> 36:33.800
<b>I shall correct
my past mistakes.</b>

37:03.810 --> 37:05.970
<b>Move out of my way!!</b>

37:22.560 --> 37:23.660
<b>I have a report.</b>

37:24.530 --> 37:28.260
<b>Saburo Taneda has broken through
our forces and run into the forest.</b>

37:29.500 --> 37:31.560
<b>The princess?
What about the princess?</b>

37:32.270 --> 37:34.570
<b>She is with Saburo.</b>

37:34.910 --> 37:35.770
<b>Idiots!!</b>

37:36.140 --> 37:38.480
<b>Taneda and the princess are
to be stopped, no matter what!</b>

37:38.480 --> 37:40.540
<b>Send the entire army
to chase after them!</b>

37:54.260 --> 37:59.320
<b>I regret to inform you that
your wife has passed away.</b>

37:59.730 --> 38:00.600
<b>Ohhh...</b>

38:01.100 --> 38:05.900
<b>I, Abumaru, am here
to fufill her final wish.</b>

38:06.310 --> 38:08.100
<b>And what would that be?</b>

38:09.280 --> 38:13.870
<b>She wishes to be reunited with you,
the madman that you are.</b>

38:14.320 --> 38:15.110
<b>What!!</b>

38:15.580 --> 38:18.350
<b>You created all this madness.</b>

38:18.750 --> 38:21.220
<b>I, Abumaru, will end it.</b>

38:24.090 --> 38:25.060
<b>For her!!</b>

39:11.410 --> 39:14.470
<b>Saburo, where are we going?</b>

39:16.640 --> 39:20.210
<b>Wherever you want, princess!
Wherever you want!!</b>

39:22.650 --> 39:25.950
<b>Actually, Saburo has
made up his mind.</b>

39:25.950 --> 39:32.150
<b>We'll escape from our enemies to
a hidden place where we can settle down.</b>

39:32.760 --> 39:38.530
<b>Then I will take this princess
and make her my wife!</b>

39:41.300 --> 39:43.400
<b>Will you allow me?</b>

39:45.640 --> 39:48.940
<b>Dreams can come true.</b>

40:00.750 --> 40:03.450
<b>How many children shall we have?</b>

40:05.190 --> 40:06.090
<b>Princess?</b>

40:13.470 --> 40:14.530
<b>Princess!!</b>

40:33.620 --> 40:37.720
<b>Saburo Taneda, we got you!!</b>

40:43.930 --> 40:47.630
<b>The Princess' burned head with death
make-up applied will be placed in a coffin...</b>

40:47.800 --> 40:52.600
<b>with Rokujyoji's dead body and
will be brought back to the capital.</b>

40:53.640 --> 40:54.470
<b>Pinoko...</b>

41:00.780 --> 41:02.180
<b>Hey, Pinoko!!</b>

41:23.000 --> 41:26.300
<b>We got stuck on a snowy road
at about 8:35.</b>

41:28.310 --> 41:31.280
<b>It had only been about fifteen minutes
since we'd been sleeping.</b>

41:32.350 --> 41:34.640
<b>While we were sleeping,
the blizzard stopped.</b>

41:46.330 --> 41:53.230
<b>I remembered having a long dream, but
I couldn't remember what it was about.</b>

42:06.150 --> 42:09.170
<b>Are you Doctor Black Jack?</b>

42:12.290 --> 42:13.150
<b>Yes. Who are you?</b>

42:14.820 --> 42:20.120
<b>Oh, you've come!! I'm Taneda.
I sent you the letter. Saburo Taneda.</b>

42:24.330 --> 42:28.170
<b>Pinoko, wake up! We reached
our destination. We're here!!</b>

42:32.310 --> 42:34.640
<b>I'm hungry.</b>

42:42.250 --> 42:46.780
<b>I'll show you the way.
We're over this way.</b>

42:50.290 --> 42:53.280
<b>How's your wife?
Did we make it in time?</b>

42:54.160 --> 42:58.390
<b>In your letter, you said you weren't sure
she'd make it through the night.</b>

42:58.870 --> 43:02.600
<b>And that package arrived two years late.
I've been very worried.</b>

43:03.700 --> 43:07.370
<b>You made it. It's quite okay.</b>

43:08.810 --> 43:12.800
<b>But you must
examine her right away.</b>

43:13.210 --> 43:14.010
<b>Of course.</b>

43:18.120 --> 43:20.310
<b>Hey, I'm back!</b>

43:30.960 --> 43:31.860
<b>Where's your wife?</b>

43:32.330 --> 43:33.960
<b>On the second floor.</b>

43:35.370 --> 43:37.530
<b>Pinoko, prepare
for the examination.</b>

43:38.110 --> 43:39.070
<b>Right away.</b>

43:54.490 --> 43:58.080
<b>Doctor Black Jack is here.</b>

43:59.290 --> 44:02.890
<b>Oh... Doctor...
You've come after all.</b>

44:03.400 --> 44:06.700
<b>Isn't it great?
It's really great.</b>

44:21.280 --> 44:23.810
<b>Obviously, there was something
wrong with her heart.</b>

44:24.750 --> 44:27.050
<b>Using the rechargeable
portable monitor...</b>

44:27.860 --> 44:29.910
<b>I examined her with the
electro-cardiogram.</b>

44:41.640 --> 44:43.330
<b>I'm surprised you
made it this long.</b>

44:44.940 --> 44:49.310
<b>You have a tumor.
It's called Mesothelioma.</b>

44:49.940 --> 44:51.770
<b>It developed on
your heart valve...</b>

44:51.880 --> 44:54.070
<b>and you'll need surgery right away
at a well-equipped hospital.</b>

44:54.780 --> 44:56.680
<b>I will need your
husband's permission.</b>

44:57.550 --> 44:58.310
<b>Mr. Taneda?</b>

45:02.220 --> 45:05.280
<b>That's strange...
where did he go?</b>

45:09.760 --> 45:11.630
<b>Mr. Taneda?!</b>

45:16.840 --> 45:18.810
<b>Taneda's not here...</b>

45:19.510 --> 45:22.100
<b>My husband died two years ago.</b>

45:28.420 --> 45:32.090
<b>But earlier he was with us
and helped us with our bags.</b>

45:32.090 --> 45:34.080
<b>And he sat over there.</b>

45:45.100 --> 45:52.400
<b>Thank you... Thank you, honey.
You're still watching over me.</b>

45:56.940 --> 46:01.040
<b>My husband died in a construction
accident two years ago.</b>

46:02.680 --> 46:07.180
<b>He told me that he consulted
you to cure my sickness.</b>

46:07.550 --> 46:11.010
<b>In order to make money,
he went to Tokyo.</b>

46:11.390 --> 46:18.960
<b>After one year, he had a bit of
the money and he contacted you.</b>

46:19.630 --> 46:28.540
<b>He died right after that in a fire
caused by a gas leak in the subway.</b>

46:33.310 --> 46:37.370
<b>So that's why the money
was in small bills...</b>

46:37.850 --> 46:39.880
<b>He earned it little by little.</b>

46:42.990 --> 46:47.390
<b>We brought the money
your husband sent us.</b>

46:47.390 --> 46:52.800
<b>If we had gotten here too late,
we were going to return the money.</b>

47:04.010 --> 47:09.610
<b>I will accept this and
do all I can to cure you.</b>

47:23.400 --> 47:26.260
<b>Hey, where are you going?</b>

47:27.870 --> 47:30.360
<b>Oh, this is my neighbor
and her son.</b>

47:30.640 --> 47:31.830
<b>We're going to the hospital!!</b>

47:32.110 --> 47:34.570
<b>I'm going to have surgery.</b>

47:35.240 --> 47:37.940
<b>That's great!</b>

47:38.450 --> 47:41.470
<b>But I wish I knew
before I made you breakfast.</b>

47:41.950 --> 47:45.410
<b>I'll take it for lunch.
I'm still growing.</b>

47:45.950 --> 47:48.680
<b>You eat so much...</b>

47:49.360 --> 47:54.590
<b>They have cared for me so
much since my husband died.</b>

47:55.760 --> 48:00.060
<b>Excuse me, we have to hurry
to the hospital. I'll write you.</b>

48:14.050 --> 48:18.280
<b>Doctor, a Mesothelioma operation...
Is it difficult?</b>

48:20.120 --> 48:21.090
<b>Yes it is.</b>

48:21.820 --> 48:24.950
<b>Usually, the patient has
a fifty-fifty percent chance.</b>

48:25.060 --> 48:26.290
<b>Hmmm...</b>

48:26.860 --> 48:34.770
<b>But... I feel this one will have
a one hundred percent success rate.</b>

49:13.210 --> 49:14.900
<b>My soul rusts</b>

49:15.910 --> 49:18.810
<b>Don't care what my body takes...</b>

49:19.350 --> 49:21.850
<b>Feeling fine</b>

49:21.850 --> 49:23.910
<b>Hey baby,</b>

49:24.550 --> 49:27.850
<b>Say it when you talk that love</b>

49:27.920 --> 49:30.520
<b>Like you know</b>

49:32.430 --> 49:35.120
<b>Forget your cold town letdowns</b>

49:37.100 --> 49:38.690
<b>Oh baby...</b>

49:40.800 --> 49:46.300
<b>Go on and scrape it away
in the moonlight!</b>

49:47.040 --> 49:51.240
<b>And I can't sleep when
it's always just me</b>

49:52.150 --> 49:56.350
<b>Cards dealt out
like in solitaire! No!</b>

49:56.350 --> 49:59.980
<b>Running with the card
I should have shook</b>

50:00.520 --> 50:04.850
<b>Stacked against me...
all along!</b>

50:04.930 --> 50:08.490
<b>Just like a black jack game...
lost!</b>

50:09.260 --> 50:12.720
<b>Your yesterday's game
already is lost</b>

50:13.370 --> 50:16.670
<b>So what if you've been
counting cards...</b>

50:17.400 --> 50:20.430
<b>I'll take my loss
and walk away...</b>

50:20.670 --> 50:23.640
<b>From your midnight hours</b>

50:25.410 --> 50:27.850
<b>Midnight hours</b>

50:28.480 --> 50:30.570
<b>DVD Subtitles - Marc Landers</b>

50:30.980 --> 50:33.080
<b>Translation - David Hair</b>
